WEBVTT

01:30.890 --> 01:34.970
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.030 --> 01:37.990
[Episode 21]

01:52.150 --> 01:53.350
You, come here.

01:55.759 --> 01:56.960
Come here. Come here.

01:59.200 --> 02:00.660
Look what I've got for you.

02:01.120 --> 02:01.580
Take it.

02:02.590 --> 02:03.390
This is for me?

02:03.510 --> 02:04.240
Yes, for you.

02:04.400 --> 02:04.860
Take it.

02:14.910 --> 02:17.000
A little gift for you.

02:19.710 --> 02:20.870
Thanks a lot.

02:24.079 --> 02:25.360
Weapons

02:25.870 --> 02:26.960
ready!

02:28.010 --> 02:28.920
Salute!

02:30.520 --> 02:31.150
One!

02:32.800 --> 02:33.240
Two!

02:34.030 --> 02:35.360
Weapons

02:35.470 --> 02:36.320
back!

02:38.470 --> 02:38.930
Nice!

02:41.960 --> 02:43.190
Nice. Excellent.

02:44.680 --> 02:45.340
Excellent!

02:45.630 --> 02:46.079
Nice.

02:46.100 --> 02:46.590
Nice.

02:57.520 --> 02:58.980
If you like it, come again!

02:59.510 --> 02:59.960
Sure.

03:40.710 --> 03:42.710
Are we sleeping in the cave tonight?

03:42.800 --> 03:45.190
We can't sleep in a cave
at this kind of time.

03:45.190 --> 03:46.790
The yin energy is too strong.

03:47.870 --> 03:49.079
You keep watch
for the first half of the night,

03:49.079 --> 03:50.740
and I'll take the second half.

03:51.079 --> 03:52.079
Just bear with it.

03:52.240 --> 03:55.060
Things will get better
once we reach the horse camp.

03:55.060 --> 03:56.920
Aren't we going back to Ningguta?

03:57.030 --> 03:59.230
Why are we going to the horse camp again?

03:59.590 --> 04:02.190
There's still a treasure
in that horse camp.

04:03.470 --> 04:05.360
Once we sell this cartload of
foreign weapons,

04:05.360 --> 04:06.890
what treasure can't we buy?

04:08.430 --> 04:10.710
My treasure can't be bought with money.

04:15.120 --> 04:15.590
Here.

04:16.390 --> 04:16.870
Take it.

04:27.070 --> 04:27.870
Tell me.

04:28.510 --> 04:30.310
After we hand over these guns,

04:31.950 --> 04:34.390
what kind of official position
do you think they'll give me?

04:34.390 --> 04:35.320
If you're lucky,

04:35.390 --> 04:37.850
they might reward you with
a general's rank.

04:51.460 --> 04:53.720
How long have you been taking this stuff?

04:53.830 --> 04:55.430
This is taboo for officials.

04:55.560 --> 04:57.480
Everyone in the official circle

04:58.360 --> 05:00.090
is secretly taking this stuff.

05:01.430 --> 05:03.460
I'll quit it once my cough is gone.

05:04.040 --> 05:05.970
I'm going to be a general, you know?

05:07.920 --> 05:09.040
A great general,

05:09.480 --> 05:11.000
mighty and imposing.

05:36.430 --> 05:39.690
Let's find a place sheltered from the wind
to hide for a bit!

05:39.950 --> 05:40.830
We can't hide!

05:42.480 --> 05:43.390
If the horses freeze to death,

05:43.390 --> 05:45.360
we'll never make it back!

05:48.120 --> 05:49.270
Just keep moving—

05:49.720 --> 05:51.920
we'll reach the horse camp before dark!

06:01.950 --> 06:04.280
There's still one more mountain to cross!

06:57.600 --> 06:58.460
Stop neighing!

06:58.940 --> 07:01.800
Are you trying to call the wolves over
or something?

07:08.110 --> 07:10.110
I've fought with them for years.

07:10.190 --> 07:12.390
They'd gather in packs trying to eat me,

07:12.480 --> 07:14.160
but didn't they end up as meat in my mouth

07:14.160 --> 07:15.820
and bedding for me to sleep on?

07:16.750 --> 07:17.870
We're leaving tomorrow.

07:17.870 --> 07:19.270
Let's bid them farewell.

07:31.510 --> 07:32.970
Look how cowardly you are.

07:33.630 --> 07:34.430
Come on.

07:35.360 --> 07:36.310
Go get some rest.

07:37.630 --> 07:39.070
I'll tie up the horses

07:39.159 --> 07:40.620
and give them some fodder.

07:41.270 --> 07:42.360
Bolt the door properly—

07:42.360 --> 07:43.960
don't let the wolves get you.

07:44.600 --> 07:47.000
There's wine in the pot.
Feel free to drink.

07:47.159 --> 07:48.890
We can't take it with us anyway.

09:50.870 --> 09:51.930
What are you doing?

10:10.840 --> 10:12.570
Do you know how to use a gun, boy?

10:22.200 --> 10:24.060
If they smell the scent of blood,

10:24.550 --> 10:25.720
they'll love it.

10:33.950 --> 10:35.150
You stole my bullets!

10:39.680 --> 10:41.010
Are you out of your mind?

10:41.600 --> 10:43.200
You planned to die all along!

10:43.630 --> 10:44.720
So why did you take me on

10:44.720 --> 10:46.380
such a long detour to get here?

10:48.870 --> 10:49.630
I want you to taste

10:49.630 --> 10:51.630
what I've been through—

10:52.320 --> 10:53.560
falling headfirst

10:54.240 --> 10:56.000
from the clouds.

11:03.000 --> 11:03.480
Fine.

11:04.720 --> 11:06.790
Now things are just the way you wanted.

11:06.790 --> 11:08.200
Go on then. Shoot me.

11:08.870 --> 11:09.480
Shoot me!

11:18.000 --> 11:19.390
In another 100 days,

11:20.200 --> 11:21.130
or even 200 days,

11:21.630 --> 11:23.360
no one will ever come here.

11:23.960 --> 11:25.200
The wolves will drag you away,

11:25.200 --> 11:27.390
leaving only a pool of blood
on the ground.

11:27.390 --> 11:28.630
When it heats up

11:29.270 --> 11:30.730
and after a few rainfalls,

11:31.270 --> 11:33.000
it'll be washed clean—

11:33.630 --> 11:35.720
like you were never here at all.

11:38.510 --> 11:39.970
I know you're out of opium.

11:41.360 --> 11:43.550
Come back to the Central Plains with me.

11:43.550 --> 11:45.210
I'll find you the best doctor.

11:45.280 --> 11:45.810
And also,

11:46.400 --> 11:47.630
that cartload of guns,

11:47.630 --> 11:49.240
I won't take a single penny
from selling them.

11:49.240 --> 11:50.100
It's all yours.

11:50.320 --> 11:52.240
My illness can't be cured!

11:52.360 --> 11:54.340
I've told you it can't be cured!

11:54.960 --> 11:56.870
I've been clinging to life with this opium

11:56.870 --> 11:58.190
just to wait for you.

11:58.630 --> 12:00.670
You've ruined my life!

12:01.200 --> 12:01.720
My illness

12:01.720 --> 12:03.550
first developed here from the cold!

12:03.550 --> 12:04.820
Everything I ever had

12:04.870 --> 12:06.300
has been ruined by you!

12:06.960 --> 12:08.510
Look carefully.

12:08.600 --> 12:10.400
This is the Ice Hell,

12:10.550 --> 12:12.860
and I'm the King of Hell!

12:53.360 --> 12:54.310
Get up, come on.

13:10.240 --> 13:10.750
Go away!

13:11.270 --> 13:11.820
Go away!

13:30.390 --> 13:30.910
Here.

13:31.000 --> 13:32.530
Are there any bullets left?

13:38.200 --> 13:39.490
No, none left.

13:43.550 --> 13:44.500
How do I check?

13:50.270 --> 13:51.530
There's only one left.

13:57.790 --> 14:00.110
The wolves are banging on the door again.

14:01.200 --> 14:04.000
It won't be long
before they break it down.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.130
The two of us

14:07.750 --> 14:09.670
are going to die sooner or later—

14:10.550 --> 14:12.310
that's all there is to it.

14:20.240 --> 14:22.960
Open this for me.

14:28.080 --> 14:29.480
So this is your treasure?

14:33.120 --> 14:36.120
My treasure is gone.

14:38.550 --> 14:41.160
When that girl surnamed Su

14:42.080 --> 14:43.870
came last time,

14:45.120 --> 14:46.930
I was on the brink of death.

14:47.960 --> 14:50.580
She left two crates of this treasure,

14:51.720 --> 14:53.910
so I could stay alive and wait for you.

14:54.120 --> 14:56.070
Isn't she just like

14:56.270 --> 14:59.160
a living Bodhisattva
who can predict everything?

15:00.120 --> 15:01.240
Su Zixuan!

15:34.260 --> 15:36.160
If I were you,

15:37.440 --> 15:38.850
I'd use this thing

15:38.960 --> 15:40.790
to put a bullet in my own head.

15:42.000 --> 15:45.720
Being torn apart by wolves hurts a lot.

16:06.600 --> 16:08.060
Judging by the direction,

16:08.360 --> 16:10.290
they should be near the horse camp.

16:10.480 --> 16:10.910
Yu'er,

16:11.390 --> 16:12.060
don't rush.

16:12.390 --> 16:13.480
The wind is strong and the snow is heavy.

16:13.480 --> 16:15.480
Let's find a local to guide us there.

16:15.870 --> 16:17.960
Isn't there a path right in front of us?

16:17.960 --> 16:18.480
Yu'er!

21:02.070 --> 21:02.680
Yu'er!

21:09.200 --> 21:09.880
Yu'er.

21:10.480 --> 21:11.200
Yu'er.

21:42.640 --> 21:43.240
Mr. Chang.

21:43.310 --> 21:43.910
My friend.

21:44.400 --> 21:46.130
We traveled day and night here.

21:47.440 --> 21:49.130
Thank heavens

21:49.240 --> 21:51.400
that you're safe and unharmed.

22:24.530 --> 22:26.790
What does the Empress Dowager look like?

22:28.880 --> 22:30.490
Just a nose and two eyes—

22:30.680 --> 22:32.010
like any normal person.

22:32.270 --> 22:33.270
I don't believe you.

22:33.270 --> 22:34.070
You're lying.

22:34.510 --> 22:35.110
I'm not.

22:35.720 --> 22:36.550
When I met her,

22:36.550 --> 22:39.150
I didn't even know
she was the Empress Dowager.

22:40.920 --> 22:42.380
She's not as pretty as you.

22:43.000 --> 22:44.410
What about Yimei?

22:45.000 --> 22:46.200
Who of us is prettier?

22:56.030 --> 22:57.310
I'm sorry, Gu.

22:58.640 --> 23:00.030
I couldn't help but ask.

23:02.060 --> 23:02.710
It's okay.

23:03.790 --> 23:04.960
Whether she's pretty or not

23:04.960 --> 23:06.360
has nothing to do with me.

23:07.590 --> 23:08.850
She chose her own path.

23:09.920 --> 23:11.200
But sometimes when I think about it,

23:11.200 --> 23:12.600
I'm quite envious of her.

23:13.030 --> 23:13.790
Why?

23:14.680 --> 23:16.170
She believed that path was right,

23:16.170 --> 23:17.230
so she just took it.

23:18.030 --> 23:18.790
In life,

23:19.590 --> 23:22.000
if you never go a little wild,
you're letting yourself down.

23:22.000 --> 23:22.820
Gu,

23:23.160 --> 23:25.620
that's something
only a true hero would say.

23:25.880 --> 23:26.960
I've been messed up like this—

23:26.960 --> 23:28.820
how could I still be called a hero?

23:30.270 --> 23:31.130
What about you?

23:31.680 --> 23:34.880
Still traveling with the horse caravan
alongside Mr. Chang?

23:34.880 --> 23:36.360
I didn't expect that
upon arriving in the capital,

23:36.360 --> 23:38.090
I'd hear that you're also here.

23:39.550 --> 23:41.100
Li Qin asked me to tell you

23:41.400 --> 23:43.330
not to go to the capital,

23:43.590 --> 23:46.120
saying people there
wouldn't treat you well.

23:46.590 --> 23:47.480
If I don't go to the capital,

23:47.480 --> 23:49.810
who am I supposed to
sell all these guns to?

23:49.830 --> 23:50.480
In this world,

23:50.480 --> 23:52.080
aside from you and Mr. Chang,

23:52.400 --> 23:54.400
hardly anyone truly cares about me.

24:05.150 --> 24:06.200
After you left,

24:06.790 --> 24:08.590
we made two more trips to Horqin.

24:09.480 --> 24:11.880
When leaving the city, I was
thinking about

24:12.830 --> 24:15.000
how you'd walked that road before.

24:16.400 --> 24:18.000
When I got to the grasslands,

24:18.200 --> 24:19.380
I thought again of

24:20.200 --> 24:21.860
the time when we were fighting

24:22.270 --> 24:23.880
and got surrounded by cavalry.

24:23.880 --> 24:24.790
You said...

24:28.480 --> 24:30.010
You said you never imagined

24:30.050 --> 24:30.750
that the two of us

24:30.750 --> 24:32.150
would end up dying there.

24:33.590 --> 24:35.170
If we had died then,

24:37.160 --> 24:39.690
wouldn't that have actually been
a blessing?

24:52.750 --> 24:55.230
Up ahead is Ningguta.

24:55.680 --> 24:57.960
Shall we revisit our old haunt?

24:59.070 --> 25:01.200
Who's revisiting old haunts with you?

25:01.680 --> 25:02.830
Once we enter the city,

25:02.830 --> 25:04.070
we'll swap for two new horses,

25:04.070 --> 25:06.200
buy some food, and continue on our way.

25:06.960 --> 25:08.590
What were you two talking about?

25:08.590 --> 25:10.360
Why are you crying like a bunny?

25:11.310 --> 25:13.110
It's too late to wipe your tears.

25:14.350 --> 25:15.240
I'm hungry.

25:15.240 --> 25:16.230
I'll go ahead.

25:39.030 --> 25:39.790
Mr. Gu.

25:40.200 --> 25:41.060
Yu'er and I

25:41.350 --> 25:43.010
won't be going to the capital.

25:43.400 --> 25:45.880
This road leads straight into Shanxi—

25:46.310 --> 25:48.040
it's very fast and convenient.

25:48.310 --> 25:49.880
Mr. Chang, have you forgotten?

25:49.880 --> 25:51.680
I've traveled this way with you before.

25:51.680 --> 25:53.280
That's right. That's right.

25:55.440 --> 25:57.880
All good things must come to an end.

25:59.550 --> 26:01.400
Let's part ways here.

26:01.880 --> 26:02.480
Mr. Chang.

26:08.200 --> 26:09.260
What is this about?

26:09.350 --> 26:11.350
Get up! Get up! I cannot accept this.

26:12.000 --> 26:12.750
Listen to me.

26:13.350 --> 26:14.950
You came from afar to save me—

26:15.590 --> 26:16.720
such noble kindness

26:17.640 --> 26:18.570
cannot be repaid

26:20.310 --> 26:21.640
with a mere "thank you."

26:21.720 --> 26:22.720
Get up now. Get up.

26:22.920 --> 26:23.780
Come on, get up!

26:25.240 --> 26:27.140
You're a good person in every way,

26:27.830 --> 26:29.150
but occasionally

26:29.200 --> 26:29.920
when you say those refined things,

26:29.920 --> 26:31.300
I really can't take it.

26:31.920 --> 26:33.590
My daughter and I
have benefited from your kindness,

26:33.590 --> 26:35.720
and this time, we've just repaid
a little of it.

26:35.720 --> 26:36.440
Actually, we're the ones

26:36.440 --> 26:37.970
who should be thanking you.

26:41.310 --> 26:41.910
All right.

26:45.200 --> 26:47.750
Young fellows grow old
in this world of strife—

26:47.750 --> 26:49.680
who knows when we'll meet again?

26:53.480 --> 26:54.030
Father.

26:54.500 --> 26:56.240
You've picked up quite a few of

26:56.270 --> 26:58.070
these pretentious phrases too.

26:58.590 --> 27:00.390
After knowing Mr. Gu for so long,

27:01.000 --> 27:03.860
isn't it only natural that
I picked up a thing or two?

27:04.200 --> 27:05.640
You two say your goodbyes properly.

27:05.640 --> 27:07.100
I'll wait for you up ahead.

27:38.440 --> 27:38.960
Yu'er.

27:43.750 --> 27:45.750
I'll be thinking of you all the time.

27:49.960 --> 27:50.510
You...

27:52.270 --> 27:53.550
Don't make me cry,

27:53.750 --> 27:55.810
or Father will just laugh at me later.

28:07.400 --> 28:08.080
How about

28:08.640 --> 28:10.170
I escort you back to Shanxi?

28:16.160 --> 28:16.880
Forget it.

28:18.310 --> 28:19.200
Even if

28:20.920 --> 28:21.750
we get to Shanxi,

28:21.750 --> 28:24.010
you're still going to leave, aren't you?

28:25.830 --> 28:27.030
I don't want to live
this kind of life anymore,

28:27.030 --> 28:29.030
always begging the sun and the moon.

28:31.240 --> 28:33.900
What do you mean,
"begging the sun and the moon?"

28:38.550 --> 28:39.400
I...

28:41.880 --> 28:44.640
I beg the sun to set later,

28:46.830 --> 28:48.640
so I can stay with you longer.

28:50.790 --> 28:51.790
I beg

28:53.110 --> 28:54.660
the moon to rise earlier,

28:54.790 --> 28:55.550
and I wish this road

28:55.550 --> 28:56.880
would never end.

29:00.440 --> 29:01.480
But doesn't every road in this world

29:01.480 --> 29:03.240
eventually come to an end?

29:04.240 --> 29:05.300
And when it does...

29:06.720 --> 29:08.050
It means we have to part.

29:09.240 --> 29:10.480
Even if we go to Shanxi together,

29:10.480 --> 29:12.080
it's not the end of the world.

29:20.000 --> 29:20.480
Yu'er.

29:25.240 --> 29:26.750
I know I owe you a lot.

29:28.350 --> 29:29.030
I'm sorry.

29:32.510 --> 29:34.240
What's there to apologize for?

29:35.000 --> 29:36.040
O-On our way here,

29:36.270 --> 29:38.330
my father secretly came to me and said

29:38.510 --> 29:39.750
someone like you,
who could venture deep into foreign lands

29:39.750 --> 29:40.920
to buy weapons for the imperial court

29:40.920 --> 29:42.240
and still escape death,

29:42.240 --> 29:43.070
must be a person

29:43.070 --> 29:44.880
blessed with great fortune,

29:45.030 --> 29:46.560
with unlimited potential.

29:46.790 --> 29:47.480
I...

29:47.960 --> 29:49.150
I agree with that.

29:50.590 --> 29:51.520
In the future...

29:52.750 --> 29:53.800
In the future,

29:54.400 --> 29:56.250
if you become a governor

29:56.440 --> 29:57.850
or a general someday,

29:58.440 --> 29:59.370
there will be...

29:59.960 --> 30:02.620
There will be many more people
who will like you.

30:07.070 --> 30:10.330
You can't possibly apologize to me
every day then, can you?

30:12.750 --> 30:14.210
You're really something.

30:14.270 --> 30:15.510
What governor or general?

30:15.510 --> 30:17.370
I've never imagined such things.

30:17.400 --> 30:18.600
Stop making fun of me.

30:23.640 --> 30:27.170
Things between men and women
in this world are always like this.

30:28.830 --> 30:30.370
Once we enter this world,

30:30.880 --> 30:32.610
we're destined for a hard life.

30:34.830 --> 30:37.000
If I could have a love
to be remembered for a lifetime,

30:37.000 --> 30:38.860
that would already be a blessing.

30:40.240 --> 30:42.160
If I still don't know contentment,

30:42.160 --> 30:43.400
even Heaven would blame me

30:43.400 --> 30:45.330
for being unappreciative, right?

30:46.830 --> 30:47.480
Gu,

30:55.880 --> 30:56.880
please live well.

30:59.200 --> 31:00.040
Do...

31:03.070 --> 31:04.730
Do things that make you happy.

31:05.240 --> 31:06.640
That's my greatest wish.

31:41.750 --> 31:43.050
I want to tell you

31:46.830 --> 31:49.360
that when life finally
settles down someday,

31:51.240 --> 31:52.500
I want to come find you.

31:54.880 --> 31:56.140
But I'm afraid that day

31:58.350 --> 32:00.350
might keep you waiting for too long.

32:49.400 --> 32:50.400
Well...

32:52.400 --> 32:54.330
Just like what my father just said,

32:55.510 --> 32:57.160
"young fellows grow old
in this world of strife."

32:57.160 --> 32:58.620
If you want to come find me,

32:59.390 --> 33:00.150
then hurry.

33:40.350 --> 33:41.590
By His Highness's command,

33:41.590 --> 33:43.720
please bring Mr. Gu in for an audience.

33:45.880 --> 33:46.850
Mr. Gu.

33:48.200 --> 33:49.990
The entire capital
has been searching for you,

33:48.570 --> 33:50.280
[Prince Gong's Mansion]

33:50.440 --> 33:52.070
making me worried sick.

33:52.310 --> 33:52.790
Come on,

33:53.000 --> 33:54.000
pay your respects to His Highness.

33:54.000 --> 33:55.790
Even for distinguished guests,

33:55.790 --> 33:56.680
His Highness has never

33:56.680 --> 33:58.480
come to the gate to welcome them.

33:59.110 --> 33:59.970
Your Highness.

34:00.240 --> 34:01.110
Please rise.

34:03.590 --> 34:04.920
You're not an official,

34:04.920 --> 34:07.190
so let's treat each other as equals.

34:07.790 --> 34:10.000
I heard about it
as soon as you entered the city.

34:10.000 --> 34:12.280
So, this cart is loaded with foreign guns?

34:12.280 --> 34:13.610
Indeed, Your Highness.

34:14.320 --> 34:15.110
Let me see.

34:16.750 --> 34:18.440
[Prince Gong's Mansion]

34:18.920 --> 34:19.670
Mr. Gu.

34:20.320 --> 34:22.150
You've had a long and tiring journey.

34:22.150 --> 34:22.920
Thank you for your efforts.

34:22.920 --> 34:23.710
Thank you, Your Highness.

34:23.710 --> 34:24.710
It was no trouble.

34:48.070 --> 34:48.760
Nice stuff.

34:50.530 --> 34:50.860
Here.

34:53.440 --> 34:54.250
Mr. Gu.

34:54.880 --> 34:55.960
I truly never expected

34:55.960 --> 34:57.440
that you'd be able to
travel such a great distance

34:57.440 --> 34:59.540
to purchase these guns
from the foreigners.

34:59.540 --> 35:00.020
This...

35:00.320 --> 35:02.850
How can I ever repay this favor?

35:04.070 --> 35:04.680
Mr. Qiao,

35:04.710 --> 35:06.150
please don't say such things.

35:06.150 --> 35:07.360
If you could truly help our country

35:07.360 --> 35:08.400
reclaim lost territory,

35:08.400 --> 35:09.280
all the common people

35:09.280 --> 35:11.280
would be eternally grateful to you.

35:13.880 --> 35:14.480
Come here.

35:14.590 --> 35:15.190
Mr. Gu.

35:15.190 --> 35:15.550
Stamp this batch of guns

35:15.550 --> 35:17.150
with the imperial court's wax seal

35:17.150 --> 35:18.770
and first send them to
the Northwest Military Supply Station.

35:18.770 --> 35:20.150
-Have our men keep a close watch.
-Mr. Gu.

35:20.150 --> 35:21.880
Don't let anyone take them away.

35:21.880 --> 35:22.920
The Empress Dowager

35:22.920 --> 35:24.030
has praised your insight

35:24.030 --> 35:25.510
in front of me several times.

35:25.510 --> 35:26.660
Do me a favor—

35:27.070 --> 35:28.800
would you be willing to serve as

35:28.840 --> 35:29.630
a Pacification Commissioner
for the imperial court?

35:29.630 --> 35:30.490
Your Highness.

35:31.190 --> 35:32.510
I've never been an official,

35:32.510 --> 35:33.790
nor do I know how to be one.

35:33.790 --> 35:35.320
A Pacification Commissioner
isn't an official,

35:35.320 --> 35:36.320
but a bridge between the imperial court

35:36.320 --> 35:37.350
and the rebels.

35:37.710 --> 35:40.000
Once the war breaks out,
casualties are inevitable.

35:40.000 --> 35:41.320
Besides, not everyone in Hefei

35:41.320 --> 35:42.670
is in collusion with the bandits.

35:42.670 --> 35:43.760
We need someone to enter the city

35:43.760 --> 35:45.390
and evacuate the civilians.

35:45.550 --> 35:46.630
This person should be

35:46.630 --> 35:47.880
a well‑known local figure—

35:47.880 --> 35:50.070
a gentry trusted by both sides
would be ideal.

35:50.070 --> 35:51.930
Besides, Anhui is your hometown.

35:52.190 --> 35:53.040
Mr. Gu,

35:53.510 --> 35:54.970
you're obligated to help.

35:55.800 --> 35:57.660
If you manage to accomplish this,

35:57.800 --> 35:58.800
I will personally

35:59.150 --> 36:00.950
grant you an official position.

36:00.960 --> 36:02.090
How does that sound?

36:03.760 --> 36:05.690
Since Your Highness has said that,

36:05.760 --> 36:07.070
for the people of my hometown,

36:07.070 --> 36:07.930
I, Gu Pingyuan,

36:08.550 --> 36:10.590
will dedicate myself to it
even at the risk of my life.

36:10.590 --> 36:11.320
It's just

36:11.670 --> 36:13.070
I have one humble request

36:13.420 --> 36:15.480
that I hope Your Highness will grant.

36:15.550 --> 36:16.150
Go ahead.

36:16.760 --> 36:18.670
Years ago, my father came to the capital
for the imperial examination

36:18.670 --> 36:19.880
and never returned.

36:20.280 --> 36:21.760
He remains missing to this day.

36:21.760 --> 36:23.400
Later, when I went to take
the imperial examination,

36:23.400 --> 36:24.840
someone at the examination hall

36:24.840 --> 36:26.710
falsely claimed my mother was gravely ill,

36:26.710 --> 36:29.230
which made me cause a scene
at the examination hall

36:29.230 --> 36:31.400
and got exiled to Ningguta subsequently.

36:31.400 --> 36:34.400
To this day, I still don't know
whether my father is alive or dead,

36:34.400 --> 36:35.800
nor who has been scheming against me

36:35.800 --> 36:37.130
from behind the scenes.

36:38.070 --> 36:39.330
I'm merely a commoner

36:39.550 --> 36:41.190
with no authority to investigate
such matters.

36:41.190 --> 36:42.030
If Your Highness

36:42.030 --> 36:43.230
could give the order,

36:43.550 --> 36:45.360
perhaps the truth could finally
come to light

36:45.360 --> 36:47.960
and resolve the greatest confusion
of my life.

36:51.070 --> 36:52.280
As a filial son,

36:52.840 --> 36:55.510
causing a scene at the examination hall
for your ill mother

36:55.510 --> 36:56.960
is understandable.

36:58.070 --> 36:59.930
But your father's disappearance

37:00.630 --> 37:02.230
is indeed somewhat strange.

37:02.880 --> 37:03.880
Here's what we do.

37:04.510 --> 37:05.640
Later tonight,

37:05.800 --> 37:07.920
write a petition
and have it delivered to my residence.

37:07.920 --> 37:09.070
I'll have
the Nine Gates Infantry Commander's men

37:09.070 --> 37:09.920
investigate for you.

37:09.920 --> 37:11.050
If there's any news,

37:11.150 --> 37:13.150
I'll have them
send word to you immediately.

37:13.150 --> 37:14.280
How does that sound?

37:15.150 --> 37:16.610
Thank you, Your Highness.

37:23.280 --> 37:25.480
The Hefei Garrison General,
Li Cheng, is really fierce.

37:25.480 --> 37:27.190
Even though the situation
has become hopeless for him,

37:27.190 --> 37:29.650
he's still putting up stubborn resistance.

37:30.590 --> 37:32.050
Let me show you something.

37:33.510 --> 37:34.840
Do you know what this is?

37:38.480 --> 37:39.190
This is...

37:39.230 --> 37:40.800
This is Hefei city.

37:43.280 --> 37:44.480
Those two mountains outside the city

37:44.480 --> 37:45.840
were taken by the Green Standard Army

37:45.840 --> 37:46.710
at the cost of countless lives.

37:46.710 --> 37:47.480
I've already sent men

37:47.480 --> 37:49.880
to transport the Western cannons
to the mountaintops.

37:49.880 --> 37:50.590
If he still refuses to surrender,

37:50.590 --> 37:51.830
we'll fire from above

37:51.960 --> 37:53.510
directly at his mansion.

37:55.630 --> 37:57.280
But if we keep fighting like that,

37:57.280 --> 37:58.070
won't all the civilians in the city

37:58.070 --> 37:59.070
be blown to death?

37:59.280 --> 38:01.880
Mr. Gu, you truly have
a compassionate heart.

38:02.400 --> 38:03.150
No one has ever cared about

38:03.150 --> 38:05.030
these civilians anyway.

38:06.070 --> 38:06.960
Mr. Gu, look.

38:07.030 --> 38:08.670
I've only encircled the city
on three sides,

38:08.670 --> 38:10.030
leaving one side open.

38:10.510 --> 38:12.840
We've been digging tunnels under the city
for nearly half a year,

38:12.840 --> 38:15.070
and we've secretly placed
30,000 catties of explosives

38:15.070 --> 38:16.400
beneath the city walls.

38:16.510 --> 38:18.280
Now that our forces
are strong and well-equipped,

38:18.280 --> 38:21.010
we can guarantee victory
in one decisive battle.

38:21.800 --> 38:24.400
Will Li Cheng and his men
be willing to retreat?

38:26.510 --> 38:27.900
He's a fierce general.

38:28.630 --> 38:30.030
We've besieged them for so long

38:30.030 --> 38:32.070
that the citizens
have even started eating rats,

38:32.070 --> 38:33.510
yet they still stand firm

38:33.590 --> 38:35.120
with undiminished morale.

38:36.110 --> 38:36.920
I wonder

38:36.960 --> 38:39.070
what kind of dark magic he's been using.

38:39.070 --> 38:41.200
They've already started eating rats?

38:42.670 --> 38:44.840
Mercy has no place in commanding troops.

38:44.840 --> 38:46.040
For someone like him,

38:47.000 --> 38:48.110
even if 100,000 people

38:48.110 --> 38:49.480
died right before his eyes,

38:49.480 --> 38:50.440
he wouldn't care.

38:50.440 --> 38:52.070
He was just granted the title of prince—

38:52.070 --> 38:53.920
if he doesn't hold on to the city
for a few more days,

38:53.920 --> 38:54.550
he'd be unworthy of

38:54.550 --> 38:56.680
the official's hat bestowed upon him.

38:58.320 --> 39:01.510
This is the number one rule
of being an official:

39:02.190 --> 39:03.510
every feather and bead
on an official's hat

39:03.510 --> 39:06.390
is stained with the common people's blood.

39:20.460 --> 39:22.410
[Public-Welfare Clinic]

39:35.760 --> 39:37.920
Didn't I tell you to set up a stall
to distribute porridge?

39:37.920 --> 39:38.780
Your Highness.

39:39.230 --> 39:40.400
In a little while,

39:40.710 --> 39:41.670
we won't even be able to run

39:41.670 --> 39:42.510
our troops' soup kitchen,

39:42.510 --> 39:43.480
let alone have anything left

39:43.480 --> 39:45.280
to distribute to the civilians.

39:57.480 --> 39:58.000
Mr. Gu?

40:05.110 --> 40:05.970
Your Highness.

40:06.230 --> 40:07.110
This is Orchid Snow tea.

40:07.110 --> 40:08.440
It's grown by my family.

40:09.360 --> 40:09.880
Look.

40:10.110 --> 40:10.970
He's startled.

40:12.710 --> 40:15.120
The Empress Dowager herself named it

40:15.320 --> 40:16.760
the Top Tea Under Heaven.

40:17.360 --> 40:18.920
How could it be anything but the best?

40:18.920 --> 40:20.110
Mr. Gu, all the tea grown by your family

40:20.110 --> 40:20.920
has been collected

40:20.920 --> 40:22.920
and delivered to the capital,
not a leaf less.

40:22.920 --> 40:24.920
But most of it ended up in the palace.

40:25.000 --> 40:26.110
We brothers

40:26.110 --> 40:27.510
only got a few taels.

40:27.760 --> 40:29.030
When the Anhui tea merchants left,

40:29.030 --> 40:29.590
you don't know

40:29.590 --> 40:31.030
how many people with money

40:31.030 --> 40:31.840
wanted to buy

40:31.840 --> 40:34.100
the Orchid Snow tea seedlings from them.

40:34.360 --> 40:35.800
Not just those from Anhui,

40:35.800 --> 40:38.150
even tea merchants
from Jiangsu, Zhejiang and Fujian

40:38.150 --> 40:38.880
wanted to destroy

40:38.880 --> 40:40.010
their own tea plants

40:40.320 --> 40:42.180
and grow Orchid Snow tea instead.

40:42.360 --> 40:43.590
That seems unnecessary.

40:43.590 --> 40:45.070
There are various exceptional teas
in this world.

40:45.070 --> 40:45.670
And there are so many excellent teas

40:45.670 --> 40:46.760
in Fujian and Zhejiang.

40:46.760 --> 40:47.670
If they were all destroyed

40:47.670 --> 40:49.200
to grow Silver Bud instead,

40:49.220 --> 40:50.750
it would be too great a pity.

40:51.070 --> 40:51.800
Mr. Gu.

40:52.630 --> 40:55.230
This is the second rule
of being an official:

40:56.000 --> 40:57.110
the value of all things in this world

40:57.110 --> 40:59.510
is determined by a single word.

41:00.480 --> 41:02.000
This is somewhat different from

41:02.000 --> 41:03.600
your business acumen.

41:08.280 --> 41:09.280
I'm enlightened.

41:09.320 --> 41:10.450
Truly enlightened.

41:13.420 --> 41:15.620
[Anhui Merchants' Hall]

41:18.830 --> 41:21.120
[Niu's Fodder Shop]

41:20.550 --> 41:22.190
Welcome! Mr. Gu.

41:22.960 --> 41:24.800
I was totally lacking in perception.

41:24.800 --> 41:26.200
Please punish me, Mr. Gu.

41:26.220 --> 41:28.060
It's too late for that now.

41:28.150 --> 41:28.710
Shut up.

41:29.630 --> 41:30.360
Old Master Hu,

41:30.360 --> 41:31.420
what's this about?

41:32.400 --> 41:34.800
I was totally
lacking in perception before.

41:34.800 --> 41:36.350
Please punish me, Mr. Gu.

41:36.440 --> 41:37.640
This is no empty talk.

41:38.550 --> 41:40.510
I've brought trouble upon everyone.

41:40.510 --> 41:41.710
I caused this trouble alone,

41:41.710 --> 41:43.150
so I should be the one
to bear the consequences.

41:43.150 --> 41:44.280
Even in front of His Highness,

41:44.280 --> 41:45.410
I would say the same.

41:45.760 --> 41:46.360
Everyone,

41:46.540 --> 41:47.830
[Anhui Merchants' Hall]

41:46.760 --> 41:48.020
you are all my seniors.

41:48.150 --> 41:50.360
Please don't shorten my life
with such gestures.

41:50.360 --> 41:51.110
Mr. Gu,

41:51.480 --> 41:52.340
please come in.

41:52.440 --> 41:53.300
Please come in.

41:53.510 --> 41:54.360
Mr. Gu Pingwen,

41:54.360 --> 41:55.000
please come in.

41:55.000 --> 41:56.150
Please, this way.

41:55.150 --> 41:56.810
[Anhui Merchants' Hall]

41:59.360 --> 41:59.920
Please.

41:59.960 --> 42:00.420
Please.

42:01.790 --> 42:04.440
[Grand Vision for Long-Lasting Prosperity]

42:02.000 --> 42:04.800
Everyone in
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association

42:05.150 --> 42:06.480
begs for your forgiveness.

42:06.480 --> 42:07.760
I cannot accept this, Old Master Hu.

42:07.760 --> 42:08.620
I really can't.

42:09.070 --> 42:09.870
Please get up.

42:12.760 --> 42:14.620
You're even older than my mother.

42:14.840 --> 42:17.100
I cannot possibly accept such a gesture.

42:17.590 --> 42:18.190
Everyone,

42:19.000 --> 42:19.840
if you truly

42:19.840 --> 42:21.100
wish to follow my lead,

42:21.360 --> 42:23.190
then please listen to what I have to say.

42:23.190 --> 42:24.790
Please, everyone be seated.

42:25.070 --> 42:25.870
Old Master Hu,

42:26.360 --> 42:28.020
please take the seat of honor.

42:36.550 --> 42:37.320
Bring it out.

42:39.960 --> 42:40.890
Don't play dumb.

42:50.480 --> 42:51.110
Everyone,

42:52.400 --> 42:54.730
I was arrogant and disrespectful in Anhui

42:54.960 --> 42:56.490
and offended Old Master Hu.

42:57.400 --> 42:58.510
Today, Old Master Hu

42:58.510 --> 42:59.800
wants to apologize to me,

42:59.800 --> 43:00.400
and I'd also like to apologize

43:00.400 --> 43:01.700
to the entire

43:01.840 --> 43:02.510
Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.
